Package: malvo
Architecture: all
Depends: openvpn3-client,
         python3-cryptography,
         python3-gi,
         python3-xdg,
         ${misc:Depends}
Description: OpenVPN3 Linux CLI front-end with credentials storage
 Malvo is a command-line front-end for OpenVPN3 Linux. It starts VPN
 sessions and reconnects on disconnection without user intervention,
 and logs session status to the terminal. It uses password-protected
 files for storing credentials.
